# web/saas-admin frontend env vars (Vite — only VITE_* are exposed to the bundle).
# Copy to .env.local and customize. .env.local is gitignored.

# Feature flag: route /pre-cadastro chat through the public onboarding
# tenant instead of the in-controlplane Clara handler. See
# docs/architecture/public-onboarding-tenant.md for the full rollout
# checklist.
#
# When BOTH variables are set AND the frontend has been rebuilt
# (Vite bakes VITE_* in at build time, not runtime), useClaraChat:
#   - opens a persistent SSE stream to ${VITE_ONBOARDING_TENANT_URL}
#     via onboardingTenantChat.openOnboardingTenantChat
#   - polls /api/v1/public/company-intakes/{id} for extracted /
#     qualified / tenant_provisioned events via
#     onboardingIntakePolling.openOnboardingIntakePolling
#   - falls back to the legacy /api/v1/public/company-intakes/{id}/chat
#     endpoint when the flag is off
#
# Pre-flip checklist (on the SaaS host, NOT here):
#   1. PICOCLAW_ONBOARDING_CALLBACK_SECRET set on the controlplane
#   2. ./scripts/provision-onboarding-tenant.sh ran successfully
#   3. curl https://onboarding.<base>/api/public/chat/health → {"ok":true}
#   4. Some abuse mitigation in front of the public chat (Cloudflare
#      Turnstile, WAF, or the per-IP rate-limit baked into
#      tenant_gateway.go — PublicChatRateLimit, 60 req/min/IP default)
#
# VITE_USE_ONBOARDING_TENANT=true
# VITE_ONBOARDING_TENANT_URL=https://onboarding.jotaduo.com
